{"a":[1,2],"h":"<div class=\"em-intro\"><p>Fussilet sûresi Sûrei secde, Sûrei hâmimissecde, Sûrei mesabîh, ve sûrei Akvat dahi denilen bu Sûre de mekkîdir.</p><p>Âyetleri - Küfî rivayetinde elli dört, Mekkî ve Medenî elli üç, Basrî ve Şamî elli iki sayılmıştır.</p><p>Kelimeleri - Yedi yüz.</p><p>Harfleri - Üç bin üç yüz elli.</p><p>Fasılası -<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"230\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 229.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"21.7 33.0 46.4 57.7 71.3 82.4 101.3 112.4 129.0 140.3 148.4 159.7 168.0 179.3 186.7 198.0 208.4 219.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> harfleridir.</p><p>Bu Sûre, sûrei Mü'minin ahirinde «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"221\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 220.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 15.0 22.4 47.3 66.0 66.0 74.3 78.7 86.3 102.0 113.3 113.3 129.0 135.7 144.0 144.0 151.4 158.3 160.4 172.4 188.3 188.3 197.3 204.0 210.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"47.3 74.3 160.4 172.4 197.3 204.0 210.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » hatimesiyle kâfirlere karşı yapılan tehdidin bir nevi' tafsıl ile bir te'yidi gibidir. Beyhekînin Şuabı iymanda Halil ibni Mürreden tahricine göre Resuli ekrem sallallahü aleyhi vesellem «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"46\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 46.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 14.3 22.4 29.3 36.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » ile «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"76\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 75.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7 18.7 51.7 60.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"31.4\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » yi okumadan uyumazdı. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"354\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 353.5 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 12.0 18.7 25.4 32.3 39.0 45.7 52.4 59.3 66.0 72.7 79.4 86.3 93.0 99.7 99.7 111.7 111.7 119.3 126.7 142.4 142.4 153.0 153.0 162.0 162.0 174.0 174.0 181.4 189.0 204.7 204.7 211.4 211.4 211.4 218.3 225.7 241.4 241.4 250.4 257.3 264.0 270.7 277.4 284.3 291.0 297.7 304.4 311.3 318.0 324.7 331.4 343.4 343.4\" y=\"25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"111.7 174.0 331.4\" y=\"20.3 20.3 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg></p></div>"}